                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2625: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-04-13T14:00:00-05:00">April 13, 1933—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. You may proceed in accordance with memorandum of policy in Haiti.<anchor
                        n="47" xml:id="d668-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
